   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CAMERA MOTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 1, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Frequency of angle changes\n   2 Hold\n   3 Camera carry\n   4 Camera move\n   5 Move speed\n   6 Move follows\n   7 Move starts on\n   8 Camera owner\n   9 Move against loudness\n  10 Shake\n  11 Time speed\n  12 suite: Handheld hunt\n  13 suite: Smooth push\n  14 suite: Object insert\n  15 suite: Loving camera\n  16 suite: Aggressive camera\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 1, CC 49 to 51\n   1 suite: Follows the voice\n   2 pair: When the camera goes handheld, gesture grows\n   3 pairs: The camera answers the body"
   },
   "pos": [
